    "description": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">We are looking for a Principal, Commercial Planning to shape the analytical and planning capability framework for &nbsp;our rapidly growing global commercial organisation. Working closely with Commercial leadership, Corporate Strategy, Finance, Revenue Operations and Offering Management, you will translate company strategy and commercial performance into actionable plans covering growth, capacity, territories, quotas, pricing and investment. </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">This is a highly visible senior individual-contributor role requiring exceptional analytical capability, commercial judgement and executive communication skills. Y</span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">ou will act as a trusted advisor to Commercial and cross-functional leadership, bringing together financial, market and operational insights to challenge assumptions, evaluate strategic choices and improve the quality of commercial decision-making across the organisation.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:300}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p aria-level=\"1\" role=\"heading\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 1\">Key </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 1\">responsibilities:</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:100,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p aria-level=\"1\" role=\"heading\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 1\">Commercial Perf