t\"> for senior leadersh</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">ip</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Define and develop, in </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">p</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">artner</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">ship</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> with Product &amp; </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Finance </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">1</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">-3 </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">year</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> commercial capacity, growth and productivity models.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Own annual and quarterly commercial planning, aligned with Corporate Strategy and FP&amp;A.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">D</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">efine and evolve</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> territory, segmentation and coverage models across regions and customer segments</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Partner with the designated Finance business partner to translate commercial plans into agreed budgets and forecasts</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">, </span></span><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">challenging assumptions and ensuring financial plans accurately reflect commercial strategy, capacity </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">requirements</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> and expected performance.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p aria-level=\"1\" role=\"heading\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 1\">Quotas, Incentives &amp; Pricing</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:100}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Develop quota methodologies and </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">provide expert input into </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">sales incentive design with Sales leadership, Finance and </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">RevOps</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Build pricing analytics and recommendations, partnering with Offering Management to</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> inform </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">and&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> evolve</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> pricing models.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Analyse</span> <span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">realised</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> pricing, discounting, margins, deal economics, exceptions and offer mix</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">, </span></span><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">identifying</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> systemic trends and recommending changes that improve commercial performance and decision-making.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Lead quarterly pricing reviews and track agreed pricing model improvements through implementation</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> to measure commercial impact</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"10\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Develop frameworks and decision criteria for evaluating complex commercial trade-offs across price, margin, growth, capacity, and strategic value.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p aria-level=\"1\" role=\"heading\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 1\">Commercial Insight</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:100}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"11\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Model cost, benefit, ROI/payback and key assumptions for headcount, technology, geographic </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">expansion</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> and route-to-market decisions.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"12\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Analyse</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> productivity, conversion, win/</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">loss</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> and commercial performance trends</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">, </span></span><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">identifying</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> underlying drivers and translating findings into recommendations for senior leadership.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"13\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Provide evidence-based recommendations on where and how the commercial </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">organisation</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> should invest and scale.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"14\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Lead </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">complex analytical work on new or ambiguous commercial questions where established methodologies or precedents may not exist.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"15\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Evaluate external market, </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">competitive</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> and internal performance signals to </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">identify</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> implications for commercial strategy and planning assumptions.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p aria-level=\"1\" role=\"heading\"><strong><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 1\">Must Have:</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"16\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Significant experience</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> in Commercial Planning, Strategy &amp; Operations, Business Planning, FP&amp;A, Revenue </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Operations</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> or a similar analytical role</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">, </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">including experience </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">advising</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> senior leadership on complex commercial decisions.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"17\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Exceptional analytical and </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">financial-modelling</span> <span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">capability</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"18\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Strong understanding of enterprise sales economics, capacity </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">planning</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> and commercial productivity.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"19\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Experience with territory, </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">quota</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> and incentive modelling</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"20\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Experience </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">analysing</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> pricing, </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">discounting</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> and commercial models</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">, </span></span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">and translating analysis into actionable commercial recommendations.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"22\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Strong business-case and scenario-modelling skills.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"23\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Ability to translate complex analysis into concise executive recommendations.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:40}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p aria-level=\"1\" role=\"heading\"><strong><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 1\">We value:&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:100,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"18\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience supporting global commercial organisations spanning multiple regions, customer segments or routes to market.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"18\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience supporting major growth, market-entry, organisational scaling or commercial transformation initiatives.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div>\n<p>Quantinuum is a leading quantum computing company delivering a full stack platform designed to make quantum computing deployable in real-world environments. With active engagements spanning pharmaceuticals, material science, financial services, government, industrial sectors, and leading academic and research institutions worldwide, we are helping organizations unlock the transformative potential of quantum computing.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Our global team of more than 800 employees includes many of the world's leading scientists, engineers, and researchers, with more than 70% of our technology team holding&nbsp;advanced degrees at the Master's or PhD level. Headquartered in Broomfield, Colorado, Quantinuum operates<strong>&nbsp;</strong>across the United States, United Kingdom, Germany, Japan, and Singapore.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>By joining Quantinuum, you’ll help shape the future of quantum computing, pushing the limits of technology, and making the impossible possible.</p>\n<div>Visit our news pages to learn more about Quantinuum and our scientific breakthroughs and achievements:&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.quantinuum.com/news\">https://www.quantinuum.com/news</a></div>\n<div><a href=\"https://youtu.be/AvBS8hCagKc?si=wDLTVApV1Nnbh3Wq\">Quantinuum Intro Video: The Future of Quantum Computing</a></div>\n<p><strong>What’s in it for you?</strong></p>\n<p>We believe our people are our greatest strength and offer a comprehensive rewards package that supports your professional growth, well-being, and long-term success.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Competitive compensation and the opportunity to work on groundbreaking technology</li>\n<li>Flexible work arrangements that support work-life balance</li>\n<li>28 days of annual leave plus bank holidays</li>\n<li>4% employer pension contributions</li>\n<li>Life Insurance</li>\n<li>Private medical insurance through Bupa</li>\n<li>Dental Insurance through Bupa</li>\n<li>Income Protection</li>\n<li>Paid Parental Leave</li>\n<li>Cycle to work scheme</li>\n<li>Contribution to eye care</li>\n<li>Employee Assistance Programme</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Equal Opportunity Employer</strong></p>\n<p>Quantinuum is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to building an inclusive workplace where all employees and applicants are treated with respect and provided equal opportunities regardless of race, colour, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, national origin, age, disability, veteran status, ancestry, marital status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law. <strong>Know Your Rights:</strong>&nbsp;Workplace discrimination is illegal. For more information about Quantinuum, please <a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.quantinuum.com/\" title=\"https://www.quantinuum.com/\">visit our website</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>We are committed to making our recruitment process accessible to all. If you require any reasonable adjustments at any stage of the application or interview process, please let us know use the Lets talk contact form.</p>\n<p>Applications will be accepted on an ongoing basis, there is no application deadline for this position.</p>\n</div><p>Find more <a href=\"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs\">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>",
